# term-hover-k (plan section 6, M8's judgment): R3 (a 2, k 1, h −1 typed into their boxes, P's x
# 0.5 typed into P's field) in Arctic Ice, the pointer on k's live term "+ 1.00" (323, 227, 82 x 36
# in the reference's DOM at 1440 x 900: its centre (364, 245)). FV 04's partners both ways: k's
# term lit in both lines (its 18 % plate and 2 px underline), k's row lit (band, name, the box's
# stroke), k's dimension line on the plane (x = h, y 0 to 1); the term's tip under it (term-tip-fv:
# "k = 1.00 · vertical shift" inverted, 4 px under the term, centred: (280.98, 267, 166.03 x 34)).
# Each click waits a frame before the typing, as text input starts when the field opens.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 300
click 383 424
wait 16
type "2"
key Enter
click 383 468
wait 16
type "1"
key Enter
click 383 573
wait 16
type "-1"
key Enter
click 330 690
wait 16
type "0.5"
key Enter
click 760 48
wait 2000
move 364 245
wait 500
shot term-hover-k
